# VHS Tape for Free Coding Agent demo GIF
# Requirements: https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
# Run: vhs docs/assets/demo.tape

Output docs/assets/demo.gif

Require free-agent

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 900
Set Height 550
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set WindowBar Colorful

Type "free-agent"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Sleep 2s
Type "Inspect pyproject.toml and summarize the project dependencies."
Sleep 1s
Enter

Sleep 6s
Type "/exit"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
